      "description": "Glad you made it through the first round, I guess.\r\n\r\nThis next contestant and I go way back. He ain't the brightest fella, but he's sure good at pummeling anything in his path.\r\n\r\nJust head on into the pit and get yourself ready while I make the announcement.",
